    p:dependsOn w:portableRustStructure ;
    p:acceptance "Publish reviewed portable rules for wire, errors, CLI and state. Measure unresolved and manually authored rules." .

w:portableRustTargets a p:Task ; rdfs:label "Build native targets from the portable contract" ;
    p:milestone w:marmishMilestone ; p:source w:portableRustPlan ; p:status p:active ; p:evidence w:portableDataRole ;
    p:reason "The standalone Rust and TypeScript modules cover the Data wire role. Full Rust API bindings, CLI replacement and an alternate implementation of a library role remain open." ;
    p:dependsOn w:portableRustSemantics ;
    p:acceptance "Build native Rust and Node targets without upstream inputs and qualify with hints removed and a library substitution." .

w:portableRustQualification a p:Task ; rdfs:label "Qualify the slice and expand across the workspace" ;
    p:milestone w:marmishMilestone ; p:source w:portableRustPlan ; p:status p:active ; p:evidence w:portableDataEvidence ;
    p:reason "The tested Data role passes scoped peers. Remaining stream and workspace rows require independent conformance and source-free builds." ;
    p:dependsOn w:portableRustTargets ;
    p:acceptance "Publish per-surface evidence and expand until every promised project row passes source-independent build and consumer checks." .

